  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary Core Funding Support to the United Nations Children&apos;s Fund (UNICEF) 2011-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support United Nations Children&#x2019;s Fund to improve its efficiency and effectiveness in the delivery of its development programmes and humanitarian assistance so that it can deliver results for children in more than 150 countries. This will contribute to the achievement of the MDGs relating to education, gender equality, child and maternal health, combating HIV / AIDS and malaria, and water and sanitation.</narrative>
  </description>
